# Files that run on the robot (Linux) keep LF line endings, also in Windows clones,
# so a script copied to the robot with scp works there. See MAINTENANCE.md, Maintainer notes.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
# systemd units, drop-ins and extensionless robot scripts (added 2026-10-30)
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
setup/tb4-https-time text eol=lf
setup/wifi-retry/tb4-wifi-retry text eol=lf
